<<!DOCTYPE type=`memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki` spec=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/memetic-wikitext`>>

<<^ code=`&#x0001;` from=`?` to=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.plugins.publishes`>>
<<^ code=`&#x0002;`>>

```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "publish this operator's own plugin collection as an offering"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///realm.plugins.publishes", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.plugins.publishes"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/realm.plugins.publishes"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.plugins.publishes ~ a gift, not a collective act

`lares nexus publish plugins source=<dir> [face=N] [apply=true | terms=true | land='<answer>']` declares this operator's own plugin collection, verified by hash by any taker. `apply=true` publishes; under a pūlama `terms=true` prints the one unsigned act its root signs and `land=` lands the signed answer.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ publish

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`publish` params=`what/plugins source/plugins apply/true ~ publish the collection`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ what · source · face · apply · terms · land

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`what` params=`takes/word needs/required seat/1 as/<plugins> ~ what to publish`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`source` params=`takes/host-path needs/required ~ the collection directory`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`face` params=`takes/handle-index ~ the face that signs`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`apply` params=`needs/one-of:apply,terms,land ~ publish`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`terms` params=`needs/one-of:apply,terms,land ~ print the terms line a pūlama signs`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`land` params=`takes/answer needs/one-of:apply,terms,land ~ land the pūlama's signed answer`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/hand key/face-root ~ signs under the face's root`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · vessel-composing · vessel-silent · vessel-locked · error

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.plugins.publishes what/plugins source/plugins apply/true]] ~ no source=, a malformed face=, or not one of apply=true, terms=true, land=`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-composing` params=`~ an unlock still recomposes the vessel; run again once lares vault status reads ready`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-silent` params=`~ something holds the store and answers nothing; lares vessel read names the holder`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`vessel-locked` params=`~ the vessel key stands shut; lares vault unlock opens it`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`error` params=`~ the store refused; the message names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ published

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`published` params=`exit/0 ~ the offering landed`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares nexus publish

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares nexus publish]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~/ahu>>

